<title>USA: State of Montana, won by D.A. Davidson. [CORRECTED 19:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>State of Montana, won by D.A. Davidson. [CORRECTED 19:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects company in headline and text to D.A. Davidson from Zions First National Bank)</p>
